WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Hello, I'm Ashanti Epps, and I'm the CEO and founder of A

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.000
Perfect Swing, Incorporated.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
And I'm honored to be a part of the Celebration 120 Advisory

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.200
Committee.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:17.500
2026 represents a historical milestone in golf's history.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.000
Clearview Golf Course, known as America's Course,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.800
will celebrate its 80th year of continuous operation

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:31.500
by the family of William Powell, a US Army veteran.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.100
Similarly, the National Black Golf Hall of Fame,

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:39.800
founded by Harold Donovan, celebrate its 40th anniversary.

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:42.100
These two organizations have come together

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:50.500
to collectively celebrate this historical moment, 120 years

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.800
celebrating golf's black history.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.600
We invite you to join us on Friday and Saturday,

00:00:56.600 --> 00:01:00.800
October the 2nd and 3rd, at the historic Clearview Golf Course

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:04.400
in East Canton, Ohio, to celebrate this historic golf

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.000
moment.
